1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:04,404
Every legend begins with a single drop.

2
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:10,500
Germany, 1934.

3
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:15,300
In Wolfenbüttel, Curt Mast perfected a secret recipe.

4
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:18,000
He called it Jägermeister.

5
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:20,554
The master hunter.

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:25,966
Fifty-six botanicals. A full year in oak.

7
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:30,882
Served ice cold, it crossed an ocean…

8
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:34,550
…and conquered the night.

9
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:39,650
Decades later, in the snowy pines of Lake Tahoe…

10
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,353
…a new kind of energy was hitting the bars.

11
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:48,296
Nobody knows for sure who dropped the first one.

12
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,734
But the moment that shot hit the glass…

13
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:56,962
…a legend was born.

14
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:00,100
One shot.

15
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:01,600
Ice cold.

16
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:03,122
Drop it.

17
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:07,200
Jägermeister.

18
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:11,058
Born in the forest. Dropped into legend.
